license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/ShuyaoGao/pronunciation-gop-lab"
url: "https://ShuyaoGao.github.io/pronunciation-gop-lab/"
abstract: >-
  A teaching demo (AI Teaching Demos) that shows step by step how phone-level pronunciation
  scores are computed with GOP: reference phonemes, frame posteriors (simulated in the browser
  demo), CTC forced alignment, GOP, calibrated thresholds and feedback, plus in-browser fluency and
  intonation measurement. Works on phones (portrait) and desktops. Includes the full Python tool.
keywords:
  - course-demo
  - pronunciation-assessment
  - speech-processing
  - ctc-alignment
